            "title_3": "2-Year Warranty",
            "raw_content_3": "<p>Agvana offers a 2-year warranty on all products. </p><p>Each piece of jewelry is rigorously tested to ensure that it is long-lasting, anti-allergic, and waterproof. </p><p>If for any reason you are not satisfied with your jewelry purchase, we will provide you with a 2-year warranty. No risk, no reward.</p>",
